{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a life simulation game where players take on the role of a programmer, experiencing the journey from university to career life.The gameplay is relatively traditional, primarily focusing on improving attributes to achieve various goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During university years, players can improve various attributes - playing sports or hiking to enhance physical fitness, recovering health through activities, or eating BBQ to restore mood. Most importantly, they need to manage class schedules, earn enough credits and maintain GPA to graduate successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After graduation, players can submit resumes online - various university experiences may become resume highlights. Upon passing job interviews, they become programmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the career phase, players need to improve professional skills, meet work KPIs while simultaneously facing real-life challenges like renting housing and other adult responsibilities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104570?t=1762179947","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104570/d7e7350eb6e52719b8357ae03154b1228ce0fa0d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762179947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104570/c41abd4406226e08c5a412a3088cc5255696742b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762179947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104570/c41abd4406226e08c5a412a3088cc5255696742b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762179947","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a life simulation game where players take on the role of a programmer, experiencing the journey from university to career life.The gameplay is relatively traditional, primarily focusing on improving attributes to achieve various goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During university years, players can improve various attributes - playing sports or hiking to enhance physical fitness, recovering health through activities, or eating BBQ to restore mood. Most importantly, they need to manage class schedules, earn enough credits and maintain GPA to graduate successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After graduation, players can submit resumes online - various university experiences may become resume highlights. Upon passing job interviews, they become programmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the career phase, players need to improve professional skills, meet work KPIs while simultaneously facing real-life challenges like renting housing and other adult responsibilities.</p>","developers":["\u7cef\u7c73\u7ccd\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104570/07fa52942e0b34a64686c4d939020eabaecc4c76/header.jpg?t=1762179947","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> \u82f9\u679c M1 \u6216\u82f1\u7279\u5c14\u9177\u777f M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970/AMD RX 480<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104570/1162847155/a8f3191be99224ceb41fbb00d6873253b1036a1d/1761624810/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761639988","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104570/1162847155/a8f3191be99224ceb41fbb00d6873253b1036a1d/1761624810/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761639988","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com